    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "欸！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "莫娜，你认真的？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当然。虽说已经是第二次星象季，/n但这次剧目角色很多，而且个性都很鲜明。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "即使有人成功拿到了角色，也一定还有不明白的地方。/n大家一起分享问题、寻找答案，再把它转化成演技上的提升。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我们重新开始工作坊吧。/n就像以前一样……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那个，莫娜……真的没事吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如果你担心有人被解雇，那不用怕。就算被发现，也由我负责。/n你们要是介意，拒绝参加也没关系。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是那个意思！莫娜你自己现在做这种事也很危险吧？/n我们看着都知道。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那个，如果只是为了我们……真的不用勉强。/n我们也不想拖拉莫娜前辈的后腿……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是那样。一直以来，和你们做工作坊，/n也会成为我重新审视自己演技的契机。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且，我之前一直因为舍不得自己而迷茫。/n甚至差点忘记自己加入这个剧团时立下的信念。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我想重新找回自己的信念。/n所以拜托了……就当帮我这个忙。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……呵呵，既然是这样，那当然OK！/n正好我一个人也练到钻牛角尖了～。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是啊……！如果能听到拉莫娜前辈的意见，我会很感激！/n……而且，我也想帮上拉莫娜前辈。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大家……谢谢。那就开始工作坊！/n先让我看看你们目前阶段的演技！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
