      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（是那次会议上的那位资深老师……！/n　为什么会在这里……！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（不，比起这个，情况更糟吧？/n　要是工作坊的事暴露……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "看来你选择了与其他人携手同行的道路。/n心里的答案已经决定了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（他明明知道，却没有责备我……？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 509,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（他投来的目光，是在审视我吗……？/n　审视会议上提到的那个“答案”。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060290",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我感觉没有必要再掩饰。/n　反倒应该让他看到。看到我的答案——）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……嗯。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "在银河座，传统非常重要。/n正是历代演员积累下来的一切，塑造了现在的银河座。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这一点……只要看看背负着那些传统的千寿历，就明白了。/n可是我……做不到对大家视而不见。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006606034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006606,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "只要伸手能够触及，我就会把手伸出去。即使只是多管闲事，/n这就是演员拉莫娜·沃尔芙。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066060340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
